{"unit_id":"wydddddcool__dsh-hover-approve#feature-1","repo":"wydddddcool/dsh-hover-approve","commit":"70cd0c3176431eab98c8f7381d7d7ecea2c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-approve 的功能「列表内处理授权」：会话有待授权操作时，在对应行旁显示工具、原因及可用的命令或文件信息，可直接允许或拒绝。点击按钮即提交与当前审批 id 绑定的响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1061-1089","lib/client.js:871-892","lib/client.js:1099-1117"]}
{"unit_id":"wydddddcool__dsh-hover-approve#feature-2","repo":"wydddddcool/dsh-hover-approve","commit":"70cd0c3176431eab98c8f8158f7381d7d7ecea2c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-approve 的功能「问题与计划确认」：单个选择题显示选项，支持单选即答或多选后确认；符合 plan-review 条件的问题显示计划内容和批准、拒绝选项。用户点击选项后，答案提交给当前会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1010-1058","lib/client.js:1124-1142"]}
{"unit_id":"wydddddcool__dsh-hover-approve#feature-3","repo":"wydddddcool/dsh-hover-approve","commit":"70cd0c3176431eab98c8f8158f7381d7d7ecea2c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-approve 的功能「阻断目标提示」：目标进入 blocked 阶段时，气泡显示阻断原因和目标内容，并提供打开会话的按钮。它从会话列表投影读取目标状态；此模式用于提示并跳转，不直接解除阻断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:992-1002","lib/client.js:346-378"]}
{"unit_id":"wydddddcool__dsh-hover-approve#feature-4","repo":"wydddddcool/dsh-hover-approve","commit":"70cd0c3176431eab98c8f8158f7381d7d7ecea2c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-approve 的功能「列表跟随与归档过滤」：插件订阅会话及工作区列表变化，在交互出现、结束或类型变化时建立、更新或移除气泡；滚动和列表重绘时重新定位。已归档的会话会被跳过。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1171-1220","lib/client.js:1236-1242"]}
{"unit_id":"wydddddcool__dsh-hover-approve#caveat-1","repo":"wydddddcool/dsh-hover-approve","commit":"70cd0c3176431eab98c8f8158f7381d7d7ecea2c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hover-approve 使用前须知：气泡定位依赖会话列表中带有 [role=\"treeitem\"] 的行；如果客户端列表结构不再提供该标记，插件将无法找到对应行并显示气泡。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:176-194","lib/client.js:828-835"]}
